Z||000002||Monkeyman||09-18-2001||04:13 AM||||Integrated Rocker Panels to be exact.  Damn nice look, but I hope you have patience.  Rumor has it that it can take months to get an order from them.  If they would ship faster and those didn't cost so much ($550 last time I checked), I'd order them.||||reg||1
Z||000003||AusFiero||09-18-2001||06:49 AM||||I had a major setback in the form of a fire Agaricx. I managed to salvage the 1/4 scoop plugs (well the scoops sections themselves)but I have been set back 4 to 6 weeks now until I ship things. I have arranged all new parts to finish the projects but have to get them from the USA and get my car back to a reasonable shape to continue and to finish the plugs. <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
